{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy designing space ships?  <br>Admirals of Ophiuchus Ship Designer allows to design fully functional\u00a0massive ships on a macro scale using a 2D, level-by-level ship designer. Recreate your favorite ships or craft entirely new ones. Equip your ship with the right blocks for the job, there are many game mechanics to exploit. <br> <br>Or play as a Fleet Admiral, commanding a whole fleet of custom designed ships. Specialize each ship for the right job. And lead your fleet in combat missions and mission chains, or against other Fleet Admirals in a two team custom battle. The missions could be played in coop with other Admirals. <br> <br>Explore all the offensive capabilities of ships. Choose from realistic projectile physics, self guided missiles instant-hitting lasers, swarms of drones, small ships, advanced hacking tactics, boarding parties or shield inhibitors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925210?t=1754930312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925210?t=1754930312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925210/786b3addca38882555dbf51f77c9d4404bbc2161/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754930312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925210/786b3addca38882555dbf51f77c9d4404bbc2161/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754930312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you enjoy designing space ships?  <br>Admirals of Ophiuchus Ship Designer allows to design fully functional\u00a0massive ships on a macro scale using a 2D, level-by-level ship designer. Recreate your favorite ships or craft entirely new ones. Equip your ship with the right blocks for the job, there are many game mechanics to exploit. <br> <br>Or play as a Fleet Admiral, commanding a whole fleet of custom designed ships. Specialize each ship for the right job. And lead your fleet in combat missions and mission chains, or against other Fleet Admirals in a two team custom battle. The missions could be played in coop with other Admirals. <br> <br>Explore all the offensive capabilities of ships. Choose from realistic projectile physics, self guided missiles instant-hitting lasers, swarms of drones, small ships, advanced hacking tactics, boarding parties or shield inhibitors.</p>","developers":["Mantegral Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925210/3bf37b52942fe8ac03b9fb6c7fe00bef80961fa8/header.jpg?t=1754930312","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Admirals of Ophiuchus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 2010+, single core performance is prefered<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated, requires Open GL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"